[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:51. Reward for Virtue]
[00:00.940]Passage 51 | 文章五十一
[00:02.675]Reward for virtue | 美德的奖赏
[00:05.860]My friend Herbert has always been fat. | 我的朋友赫伯特一直都很胖。
[00:10.840]But things got so bad recently | 但最近情况变得很糟糕，
[00:13.925]that he decided to go on a diet. | 以至于他决定节食。
[00:17.105]He began his diet a week ago. | 他一周前开始节食。
[00:21.135]First of all, he wrote out a long list of all the foods which were forbidden. | 首先，他列出了一长串所有被禁的食物。
[00:27.570]The list included most of the things Herbert loves: | 这份清单包括了赫伯特喜欢的大部分东西：
[00:32.055]butter, potatoes, rice, beer, milk, chocolate and sweets. | 黄油、土豆、米饭、啤酒、牛奶、巧克力和糖果。
[00:40.635]Yesterday I paid him a visit. | 昨天我拜访了他。
[00:44.000]I rang the bell and was not surprised to see that Herbert was still as fat as ever. | 我按了门铃，看到赫伯特仍然和以前一样胖，一点也不惊讶。
[00:51.280]He led me into his room and hurriedly hid a large parcel under his desk. | 他领我进了房间，然后匆忙地把一个大包裹藏在他的书桌下。
[00:58.050]It was obvious that he was very embarrassed. | 很明显，他非常尴尬。
[01:01.650]When I asked him what he was doing, he smiled guiltily | 当我问他在做什么时，他内疚地笑了笑，
[01:06.400]and then put the parcel on the desk. | 然后把包裹放在了书桌上。
[01:09.455]He explained that his diet was so strict | 他解释说他的节食计划非常严格，
[01:13.085]that he had to reward himself occasionally. | 以至于他偶尔不得不奖励自己一下。
[01:16.620]Then he showed me the contents of the parcel. | 然后他给我看了包裹里的东西。
[01:20.495]It contained five large bars of chocolate and three bags of sweets. | 里面有五大块巧克力和三袋糖果。